{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:382f77f4d2dc3b750420f3c6fe0cb6c7066418e521b57c71d0c5ee71efce95ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f54c15842674e6ba2866d81036fe02149c701e0afef34de185a6e4bd2d24e332",
      "text": "用餐区",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14cc256249d277f43e90d7d2d18cf0a7b557d91ee86c046995972f105f1c2b22",
      "text": "原来如此，里面加入了果冻……\n非常高雅的风味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0d2768ef79c74454660bdc7bb62bdd1b95c9410168fcb84e4f103664893609a",
      "text": "而且，这个剖面。不仅是味道，\n慕斯、果冻、海绵蛋糕的配色也无可挑剔呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ed4cd7b41b8fb0f373c493aba3b88bf626a035c3ca989301f57f13222d86fa1",
      "text": "（庄一郎先生一直在做笔记。\n而且表情超级认真）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec904ab95df8f4340bf66cefd2228b22bab2dc45f01a92362584dbcdfa4c8069",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n那边的甜点味道如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5969d3db250809294bd0c44df67458c66fe625876ce66aff3348466c81fd33dc",
      "text": "啊、是的。面糊里加入了红茶叶，\n口感非常特别。您看，香气也很棒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1bc6b3623b549a8ed84a98a162532f1447be9cf2031dd91216d82e863684dc9",
      "text": "……啊，确实有股华丽的香气呢。\n甜点的世界观仿佛包裹住了全身。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3d68cff90107e1a088d30d13b02028c077d721e7165e82fecff72a41565873b",
      "text": "那么接下来，能否请你也尝尝这个……\n哎呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aea9e084d2922d5b9487e6f954e3e103aff28a181dd960f4362a27dc3cde923",
      "text": "不好意思。\n从刚才开始就一直在让你配合我的节奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11197d38cbaf65d87704f459665a916205bb7bc8b960bdbfe107394834dc7088",
      "text": "毕竟难得有能一口气研究这么多甜点的机会，\n不知不觉就沉迷进去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfccc02b8e0ab18349be9472ca72508d77c48ffd3a5ad3bce2dcb5c11ca48f9",
      "text": "哪里的话，能重新认识到庄一郎先生对甜点的热情，\n我也觉得非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
